  "body": "Looking at the latest DOM specification [1], it seems that the DOMTokenList stringifier basically does the same thing as the 'value' attribute getter. Therefore, shouldn't we be able to make 'value' a stringifier attribute?\n\ni.e.\n[CEReactions] stringifier attribute DOMString value;\n\n[1] https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist\n",
